COMBAT
  Train your combat in this order:
    Attack to 40, THEN strenght to 40, THEN defender to 40
    After switch to magic until all runes are gone
    After switch to range until all runes are gone
    Switch back to Attack to 60, THEN strength to 60, then Attack to 70
    Back To magic and range

  Achieve this by:
    10-20 Cows @ Lumbridge Cow Field:
      Reasons:
        hides sell
        beef sells
        food drops
      Location:
        From Lumbridge Castle:
          Walk north past the castle
          Cross the bridge
          Go east toward the farm
          Enter the fenced cow area
      Closest Bank:
        Walk south to Lumbridge bank
    20-40 Giant Frogs [bury big bones for prayer] @ Lumbridge Swamp
        Benifits:
            Big Bones
            Runes
            Coins
        Location:
            From Lumbridge Castle:
                Exit the castle
                Go south through the graveyard
                Enter Lumbridge Swamp
                Walk around the south/southwest swamp area
    40-60 Hill Giants [bury big bones for prayer] @ Edgeville Dungeon
      Benefits:
        Big Bones
        Limpwurt roots
        Giant Keys
      Location:
        Easy entrance (no brass key):
          From Edgeville:
            Go south of Edgeville bank
            Find the dungeon entrance/trapdoor
            Enter
            Go south through the dungeon
        2nd entrance is on the east side of the river, closer to varrock, and requires a brass key
          
    60+ Ogress Warriors @ Corsair Cove Dungeon
      Benifits:
        Rune items
        RUNES: Nature,Law, Cosmic
        High-level herbs
        Good combat XP
        Very AFK
      Location:
        Southwest area of the map "Corsair Cove" then inside a dungeon


